; Extension §1/§3: `X` occurs only in sort-transparent columns — an arity-only
; declaration propagates a sort but never supplies one — so the fixpoint reaches
; a least solution in which `X` has none. An error at the variable, with the fix
; named: give a column a sort.

(relation p 1)
(relation q 1)

(rule (p X)
  (q X))
